+	/*
+	 * Command type 0 (UTP_CMD_TYPE_SCSI) for UFSHCI >= 2.1. The old
+	 * 1u << 28 was UTP_CMD_TYPE_UFS_STORAGE, which is 2.0 only and
+	 * made the device treat every command as an unknown type.
